SRCGuard
========

This project is an external safety/compliance harness around Strix
(https://github.com/usestrix/strix, Strix 1.7.0).

- It contains no Strix source code and does not modify Strix.
- Strix is a separate project distributed under its own license; obtain and use
  it according to its terms.
- SRCGuard only reads Strix's run artifacts (reports, coverage, state) and
  constrains the runtime from the outside (nftables cage, proxy observation,
  MCP command guard, LLM gateway policy injection).

Use SRCGuard only against systems you are explicitly authorized to test.
